[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/gravewell-pit.png" id="3_icon"]

; Two archetypes at once: aimed at random ground rather than at an enemy, and triggered by
; proximity rather than by a clock. The timer only decides when a trap is PLACED.
;
; BaseRange is how far out it looks for an approaching enemy to open a pit ahead of, so range
; upgrades reach further down the swarm's path.
;
; The damage table was trimmed on 2026-10-23 (base 14 -> 12, levels 2/5/8 +4/+5/+6 -> +3/+3/+3) when
; the pit started going where enemies walk and its evolutions' Area and Amount started reaching it:
; measured with the balance bot, level 8 with Titan Cataclysm went 275 -> 680 damage a second with the
; old numbers, against 331-465 for its peers, and 527 after this trim alone; the blast radius went
; 94 -> 86 px with it (GravewellTrap.BaseBlastRadius). .ai/spell-roster.md, Gravewell, has the tables.

